  "label": "Meme Scene with Three Individuals and Text Overlays",
  "description": "A vertically stacked meme scene composed of three distinct visual panels, each featuring a different person and accompanied by text overlays that form a narrative. The top panel shows a woman in a floral jacket, the middle panel shows a man with braided hair, and the bottom panel shows a woman holding a microphone in front of an American flag. Text overlays frame the narrative: 'when nobody knew who you were' above the top image and 'until you got on your knees' below the bottom image. The spatial arrangement is linear, with each visual panel separated by white space, creating a clear sequence of images that support the meme's textual message.",
